IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hra-dates`
IMPORT `hra-rules`
IMPORT `hra-seat`

-- Health Records Act 2001 (Vic) -- worked cases for the individual's questions (hra-seat.l4), the shared rules
-- (hra-rules.l4) and the date helpers (hra-dates.l4). Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text;
-- none was copied from the encoding's output. Each assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the
-- law. The facts are illustrative.
-- BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `cases`

`d` MEANS `the calendar date`
`any day` MEANS `the calendar date` 1 1 2000
`no ground` MEANS `no other ground`

§§ `Dates`

-- 45 days after 1 March 2027: 30 to 31 March, 15 more to 15 April 2027. 300 months after 29 February 2000 is February
-- 2025, which has no 29th: 28 February 2025 (fork F2). 84 months after 31 January 2020 is 31 January 2027. 21 days after
-- 20 February 2027: 8 to 28 February, 13 more to 13 March 2027.
#ASSERT `the date` 45 `days after` (`d` 1 3 2027) EQUALS `d` 15 4 2027
#ASSERT `the date` 300 `months after` (`d` 29 2 2000) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2025
#ASSERT `the date` 84 `months after` (`d` 31 1 2020) EQUALS `d` 31 1 2027
#ASSERT `the date` 21 `days after` (`d` 20 2 2027) EQUALS `d` 13 3 2027
#ASSERT `the later of` (`d` 17 4 2027) `and` (`d` 15 4 2027) EQUALS `d` 17 4 2027
#ASSERT `the later of` (`d` 12 3 2027) `and` (`d` 15 4 2027) EQUALS `d` 15 4 2027

§§ `s 3 -- health information, immediate family member`

-- Arguments: about my health or a health service; collected in providing a health service; donation; predictive genetic;
-- identifiable; dead more than 30 years; prescribed exempt.
#ASSERT `Is it my health information` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it my health information` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it my health information` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it my health information` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- Not identifiable: not personal information, so not health information.
#ASSERT `Is it my health information` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- Dead more than 30 years: "does not include".
#ASSERT `Is it my health information` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Is it my health information` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Is it my health information` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE

#ASSERT `s 3 -- an immediate family member` `my parent` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3 -- an immediate family member` `a relative living in my household` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3 -- an immediate family member` `a person I nominated to the health service provider` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3 -- an immediate family member` `a relative not living in my household` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 3 -- an immediate family member` `someone else` EQUALS FALSE

